MODULE: SourceMatchesDecisionPrepareExposed
TARGET: SourceMatchesDecision
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an undecided prepare is installed into source state on WAL append
PERTURBS: AppendPrepare

--- FIND
    /\ log' = Append(log, e)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<stamps, outcome, source, read, checkpoint, staged,
--- REPLACE
    /\ log' = Append(log, e)
    /\ source' = Replace(source, e)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<stamps, outcome, read, checkpoint, staged,
--- END
